WEBVTT

00:00:57.719 --> 00:01:00.000
olishini oldindan aytib bera olardilar.

00:01:01.219 --> 00:01:04.152
Boshqa bir vinetkada, Barak Obamaning 
suratiga ko’zim tushdi.

00:01:04.928 --> 00:01:06.403
Suratini ilk bor ko’rganimda,

00:01:06.427 --> 00:01:09.586
uning g’ayritabiiy kuchlari super 
yoqalarida deb o’yladim.

00:01:09.610 --> 00:01:10.690
(Kulgu)

00:01:10.714 --> 00:01:12.681
Biroq gap tabassumida ekanligini bildim.

00:01:13.650 --> 00:01:19.006
Yana bir aha! 2010-yil Uoyne Davlat 
Universitetining 50-yillar Asosiy Liga

00:01:19.030 --> 00:01:23.269
o’yinchilari kartalarini ko'zdan 
kechirgan tadqiqot proyektida yuz berdi.

00:01:23.776 --> 00:01:27.283
Tadqiqotchilar o’yinchining jilmayish 
oralig'i uning umr ko’rish

00:01:27.307 --> 00:01:29.976
yoshi oralig’ini oldindan aytishi
mumkinligini aniqladi.